@startuml NovaMarket_Order_Saga_Success
title Sequence Diagram: Successful Order Placement (Happy Path)

actor Buyer as buyer
participant "Mobile App" as app
participant "API Gateway" as gateway
participant "Order Service" as order
participant "Inventory Service" as inventory
participant "Payment Service" as payment
participant "Delivery Service" as delivery
participant "Notification Service" as notification
participant "Message Broker" as broker
participant "Payment Gateway" as pgateway
participant "Logistics Provider" as logistics

== Step 1: Create Order ==
buyer -> app: Оформить заказ
app -> gateway: POST /orders
gateway -> order: CreateOrderCommand
order -> order: Validate order data
order -> broker: Publish OrderCreated
order --> gateway: OrderCreated (201)
gateway --> app: Order ID
app --> buyer: Заказ создан

== Step 2: Reserve Inventory ==
broker -> inventory: Consume OrderCreated
inventory -> inventory: Check availability
inventory -> inventory: Reserve items
inventory -> broker: Publish InventoryReserved
inventory --> order: InventoryReserved

== Step 3: Process Payment ==
broker -> payment: Consume InventoryReserved
payment -> pgateway: ProcessPayment()
pgateway --> payment: PaymentSuccess
payment -> broker: Publish PaymentProcessed
payment --> order: PaymentProcessed

== Step 4: Request Delivery ==
broker -> delivery: Consume PaymentProcessed
delivery -> logistics: CreateDeliveryRequest()
logistics --> delivery: DeliveryAccepted
delivery -> broker: Publish DeliveryRequested
delivery --> order: DeliveryRequested

== Step 5: Complete Order ==
order -> order: Update status to COMPLETED
order -> broker: Publish OrderCompleted
broker -> notification: Consume OrderCompleted
notification -> buyer: Push: Заказ оформлен
notification -> broker: Publish NotificationSent

note over buyer, logistics: Order successfully completed!

@enduml